            "description": "Complete single-page landing promoting VoodBuilder, using theme tokens (bg-vp-*, text-vp-*, brand) for light/dark.",
            "html": "<section class=\"vb-landing-voodbuilder relative overflow-hidden bg-vp-bg-alt body-font\" data-gjs-type=\"default\">\n  <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-vp-brand-1/10\"></div>\n  <div class=\"relative mx-auto flex min-h-[78vh] max-w-6xl flex-col items-center justify-center px-6 py-24 text-center\">\n    <p class=\"mb-4 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] text-vp-brand-2\">Voodflow · Visual CMS</p>\n    <h1 class=\"title-font mb-6 max-w-4xl text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-vp-text-1 sm:text-6xl\">Build marketing sites inside Laravel — with VoodBuilder</h1>\n    <p class=\"mb-10 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Visual page builder, Filament admin, theme system and optional commercial modules. Ship landings, docs chrome and content channels without leaving your stack.</p>\n    <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-4\">\n      <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg border-0 bg-vp-brand-1 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white hover:bg-vp-brand-2 focus:outline-none\">Explore Voodflow</a>\n      <a href=\"#features\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-vp-text-1 hover:bg-vp-gray-soft focus:outline-none\">See what you get</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section id=\"features\" class=\"vb-landing-voodbuilder bg-vp-bg py-20 body-font text-vp-text-2\" data-gjs-type=\"default\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto mb-14 max-w-2xl text-center\">\n      <h2 class=\"title-font mb-3 text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">One builder. Real Laravel product.</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-base leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">VoodBuilder is the public-site layer for teams already on Filament: pages, chrome layouts, themes and an Editor that stays in sync with your deploy.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3\">\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Editor</p>\n        <h3 class=\"title-font mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Visual landings</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Compose full pages with blocks, Style Manager and self-hosted fonts. Save, reuse and install templates from the marketplace URL flow.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Themes</p>\n        <h3 class=\"title-font mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Sub-themes &amp; chrome</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Header, footer and content width live as chrome layouts. Light/dark tokens and admin color overrides keep brand control on the live site.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8\">\n        <p class=\"mb-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-1\">Modules</p>\n        <h3 class=\"title-font mb-3 text-xl font-semibold text-vp-text-1\">Grow when you need</h3>\n        <p class=\"text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">Core ships list/apply templates and install-from-URL. Companions unlock popups, components, dynamic data and advanced template authoring.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"vb-landing-voodbuilder border-y border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-alt py-16 body-font\" data-gjs-type=\"default\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-6 text-center md:grid-cols-4\">\n    <div><p class=\"title-font text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Editor</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">GrapesJS + Tailwind</p></div>\n    <div><p class=\"title-font text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Filament</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Admin for editors</p></div>\n    <div><p class=\"title-font text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Themes</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Tokens &amp; sub-themes</p></div>\n    <div><p class=\"title-font text-3xl font-bold text-vp-brand-1\">Plugins</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-vp-text-3\">Optional companions</p></div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"vb-landing-voodbuilder bg-vp-bg py-20 body-font text-vp-text-2\" data-gjs-type=\"default\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6\">\n    <div class=\"grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2\">\n      <div>\n        <h2 class=\"title-font mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-vp-text-1\">From blank page to published landing</h2>\n        <ol class=\"space-y-5 text-sm leading-relaxed\">\n          <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">1</span><span class=\"text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Open the Editor</strong> on a Site Page and drop sections from the block library.</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">2</span><span class=\"text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Style with tokens</strong> — brand colors, typography and dark mode follow your theme.</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">3</span><span class=\"text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Save as template</strong> or install a bundle from a secure HTTPS URL.</span></li>\n          <li class=\"flex gap-3\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-vp-brand-1 text-xs font-bold text-white\">4</span><span class=\"text-vp-text-2\"><strong class=\"text-vp-text-1\">Publish</strong> — visitors get the live page with JIT CSS and self-hosted fonts.</span></li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"rounded-3xl border border-vp-divider bg-vp-bg-elv p-8 text-left shadow-xl\">\n        <p class=\"mb-3 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-vp-brand-2\">Why teams pick it</p>\n        <ul class=\"space-y-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-vp-text-2\">\n          <li class=\"text-vp-text-1\">✓ Stays inside Laravel — no separate headless frontend.</li>\n          <li>✓ Filament UX editors already know.</li>\n          <li>✓ Commercial soft-gates: Core consumes, companions author.</li>\n          <li>✓ Privacy-friendly fonts (no Google Fonts CDN in Core).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"vb-landing-voodbuilder bg-vp-brand-1 py-20 text-center body-font text-white\" data-gjs-type=\"default\">\n  <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6\">\n    <h2 class=\"title-font mb-4 text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl\">Ready to build with VoodBuilder?</h2>\n    <p class=\"mb-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80\">Install Core, register the Filament plugin, run Vite — then open a Site Page and start composing. Add companion packages when you need popups, components or advanced templates.</p>\n    <a href=\"https://voodflow.com\" class=\"inline-flex rounded-lg bg-vp-bg-elv px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-vp-brand-1 hover:bg-vp-bg focus:outline-none\">Get started with Voodflow</a>\n  </div>\n</section>",
            "css": ".vb-landing-voodbuilder a{transition:opacity .15s ease,background-color .15s ease,color .15s ease}",
